flowchart TD
  Stmt[Stakeholder sentence] --> Q1{Do we control this limit?}
  Q1 -->|No, verified| Con[Constraint: edition, regulation, system of record]
  Q1 -->|Believed, not proven| Asm[Assumption: write a validation test]
  Q1 -->|Yes, a want| Q2{Is it what vs how well?}
  Q2 -->|What the business does| FR[Functional requirement]
  Q2 -->|How well: security, speed, ownership| NFR[Nonfunctional requirement]
  NFR --> Q3{Two goods collide?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Trade[Explicit trade-off using Well-Architected compasses]
  Q3 -->|No| Spec[Keep both in the spec]
